OL,3,GNEWSAWhy museum's last mummy has been
OL,4,Ataken off display
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mummified body of an ancient
OL,7,FEgyptian woman has been removed from a
OL,8,Fmuseum exhibition after more than 200
OL,9,Fyears on display as part of efforts to
OL,10,Frespect "the wishes of the dead",
OL,11,Fcurators have said.
OL,13,FLayers of linen were carefully peeled
OL,14,Faway from the 2,700-year-old remains of
OL,15,Fthe woman named Asru when she was first
OL,16,Ftaken out of her wooden coffin and put
OL,17,Fon public display in Manchester in
OL,18,F1825.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
