OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1789197948
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWhy museum's last mummy has been
OL,4,Ataken off display
OL,5,
OL,6,FCenturies later, her remains have been
OL,7,Fplaced in storage in a decision that
OL,8,F"aligns most closely with what we
OL,9,Funderstand about her own wishes", a
OL,10,FManchester Museum spokesman said.
OL,12,F"Elite Egyptians of her time expected
OL,13,Fthat their mummified bodies would
OL,14,Fremain wrapped in their coffins,
OL,15,Finvisible to the living," he added.
